The important part is that **nothing gets replaced by a newly invented term**. Every inverted term carries its original source alongside it, so you have a direct mapping:

$$
\boxed{
L_i^{\rm SM}
\longrightarrow
\mathfrak I_i(L_i^{\rm SM})
}
$$

for every extracted term.

